{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/438057-yet-another-lfg-thread","id":438057,"title":"Yet Another LFG Thread","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-11T22:44:25-07:00","id":438057,"title":"Yet Another LFG Thread","content":"Hey all, I'm a bit of a lurker here on the site and have been chewing through Werewolf 2e lately. So far, I'm loving it, Werewolf was what made me fall in love with the World of Darkness, but even though I've consumed Changeling, Werewolf, Promethean, and Mummy I have yet to actually play a game. I've tried digging up groups online to no avail, and even tried running a Demon campaign (that I quickly got waaaay in over my head on, it was my first time as a DM). But 2e has finally pushed me over the edge. So here I am wondering if anyone knows anything in regards to finding a joinable game. I'm assuming it would likely be online, as my transportation options are somewhat limited. Whatever you guys have let me know, appreciate it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T09:48:37-07:00","id":438588,"title":"","content":"You might also want to try the Conventions and Gatherings subforum, which in addition to in-person gatherings has LFG for our Play by Post forum. I would be very interested in joining a group online, but I would not be able to ST.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T10:46:31-07:00","id":438680,"title":"","content":"Looking to do some online gaming? Try checking out the Tabletop RPG One Shot Group on Facebook. Some groups on there will do continued games if they like the group enough. Fair warning, D&amp;D is the most popular game that is sought after on there, but that is merely because D&amp;D is hugely popular in our small community. Just join, and make a post, you'll get replies soon enough.<br /> Link: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/groups/tabletoprpgoneshot/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/groups/tabletoprpgoneshot/<br /> <br /> E</a>dit: Most people play games through Google Hangouts in the Youtube RPG Brigade and the One Shot Group (OSG). Some people might settle with Skype also.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1310,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1310-samare","user":"Samare","date":".  Added some details. 03-12-2015, 01:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1310-samare","name":"Samare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1310_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"65"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T16:02:23-07:00","id":439006,"title":"","content":"Thanks guys, appreciate the recommendations. I'll be sure to check them out and hopefully find something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T16:28:21-07:00","id":439031,"title":"","content":"Give reddit a try too. If you're unfamiliar its basically a giant forum with thousands of sub-forums on any topic you can think of. reddit.com/r/lfg is a subreddit (subforum) dedicated to finding or forming a group in your area or online via Skype or RPG virtual table-tops like Roll20 (and yes there's a /r/roll20 as well). The WoD subreddit is /r/whitewolfrpg. It doesn't see as much use as this forum. I think personally it needs a name change to r/OnyxPath or r/WorldofDarkness.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1824-xaielao","name":"Xaielao","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1824_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T12:56:09-07:00","id":525804,"title":"","content":"I know it's been a while, but anyone here still looking for a game? Blue Biscut posted an LFG thread in the conventions and gatherings subforum. Two takers so far (not including Blue Biscut) and looking for at least two more. If anyone is willing to ST that would be great, but if not Blue Biscut has offered to do it if no one else is interested.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T20:08:23-07:00","id":526258,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/438057-yet-another-lfg-thread?p=525804#post525804\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know it's been a while, but anyone here still looking for a game? Blue Biscut posted an LFG thread in the conventions and gatherings subforum. Two takers so far (not including Blue Biscut) and looking for at least two more. If anyone is willing to ST that would be great, but if not Blue Biscut has offered to do it if no one else is interested.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. I'll take a look.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T11:58:43-07:00","id":533480,"title":"","content":"Mush/MUD/MUX gaming is still a thing too. There are still hundreds, if not thousands, of people that play. Many of them are world of darkness style. It's totally online, too. Generally, you're playing in a city populated by hundreds of other werewolves and other supernatural creatures, all run by other players for the most part, with several overarching ST's (usually referred to as Staff) that help steer the larger plot while individual PCs can ST stories on a smaller scale.<br /> <br /> There's something of a learning curve to figuring out how to navigate, though most of us are willing to help newbies.<br /> <br /> Check out <a href=\"http://reno.mechanipus.com/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://reno.mechanipus.com/wiki/Main_Page</a> or <a href=\"http://thereachmux.org/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">http://thereachmux.org/wiki/Main_Page</a><br /> <br /> There are others too, for sure, but those are two of the most popular, and incredibly newbie friendly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5309-chancetr","name":"ChanceTR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5309_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T12:24:55-07:00","id":533517,"title":"","content":"Have they actually ported the actual second edition rules yet, or is it still a mess?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-30T18:23:16-07:00","id":533859,"title":"","content":"The Reach is currently a terrible mess, and I think they're moving back to 1E. Reno I don't know about, I don't actually play there. I play on Eldritch, which I highly recommend, but it's closed to full supernatural templates for the time being. New players would only be able to app in things like wolf-bloods, ghouls etc. They do, however, use straight 2E. If you're cool with being a WB or whatever until you can get a slot to do a first change, check it out.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://eldritch.mechanipus.com/w/index.php/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://eldritch.mechanipus.com/w/index.php/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://eldritch.mechanipus.com/w/index.php/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\"> http://eldritch.mechanipus.com/w/index.php/Main_Page </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5309-chancetr","name":"ChanceTR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5309_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T22:35:56-07:00","id":536540,"title":"","content":"I don't play here at the moment but a 2E site started up over at <a href=\"https://www.Stranger-Things.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.Stranger-Things.com</a>. They use some hacks for Changeling and Mage since those books aren't out yet. Its forums based and different cities depending which splat you want to play.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1385-nickpire84","name":"Nickpire84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1385_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"99"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T18:28:01-07:00","id":552430,"title":"","content":"I am putting together a game on Roll20. It's Werewolf 2nd Edition and it'll either play on Sundays or Friday evenings. (probably Sundays) Here's a <a href=\"https://app.roll20.net/lfg/listing/26538/barbarians-at-the-gate\" target=\"_blank\">link</a> if you or anyone else is interested.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6422-lionel","name":"Lionel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6422_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}